<title>BELGIUM: EU finance ministers will not meet on June 23.</title>
<headline>EU finance ministers will not meet on June 23.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A tentatively scheduled meeting of European Union finance ministers on June 23 has been cancelled, an EU spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The meeting, which was provisionally scheduled earlier this year, was not seen as necessary given the outcome of the Amsterdam summit of EU leaders earlier this week.</p>
<p>The next scheduled gathering is on July 7 in Brussels.</p>
</text>
